<title>USA: Unilever's Quest buys Rhone Poulenc's Siebel unit.</title>
<headline>Unilever's Quest buys Rhone Poulenc's Siebel unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quest International, a unit of Unilever NV, has agreed to buy the J.E. Siebel Sons' Co unit of Rhone-Poulenc SA for an undisclosed amount, the companies said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>J.E. Siebel Sons' Co. markets enzymes, foam and flavor stabilizers and a wide range of other processing aids used in brewing. It is based in Chicago.</p>
</text>
